        "text": "Page: Death in Paradise (TV series). Sentence: Death in Paradise is a British-French crime comedy-drama television series created by Robert Thorogood, starring Ben Miller (series 1–3), Kris Marshall (series 3–6) & Ardal O'Hanlon (series 6–present).\nPage: Ardal O'Hanlon. Sentence: He played Father Dougal McGuire in \"Father Ted\", George Sunday/Thermoman in \"My Hero\", and DI Jack Mooney in \"Death in Paradise\".\nPage: Sara Martins. Sentence: She appeared as Detective Sergeant Camille Bordey in the joint British-French crime comedy-drama \"Death in Paradise\", filmed in Guadeloupe, a French overseas department.",
